        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Achilles-Sword II</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey in an action RPG filled with exploration, progression, and strategic combat. Choose between <strong>three playable characters</strong>, each with unique abilities, fighting styles, and progression paths. Build your own strategy as you switch between brute strength, magical intellect, or lethal agility.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open World &amp; Challenging Dungeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mysterious and dangerous dungeons packed with challenges, traps, dark creatures, and hidden secrets. Face <strong>powerful demons</strong> that lurk in the depths and grow stronger as you advance. Every battle rewards you with resources, experience, and opportunities to enhance your hero.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engaging Character Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, distribute attribute points, unlock <strong>devastating spells</strong>, and improve your abilities to shape your character the way you want. The more you evolve, the harder the challenges become — and the more rewarding the victories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to push your limits in an adventure where progression, customization, and strategy go hand in hand. Enter the dungeons… and prove you have what it takes to defeat the darkness consuming this world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Economy &amp; Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins by exploring dungeons, acquire loyal <strong>pet companions</strong>, and purchase <strong>potions</strong> to maximize your survival. Manage your resources wisely and make the most of everything you earn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Progression RPG</strong> focused on leveling up, evolving attributes, unlocking powerful spells, and exploring challenging dungeons — featuring pets, potions, and plenty of action.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Achilles-Sword II</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey in an action RPG filled with exploration, progression, and strategic combat. Choose between <strong>three playable characters</strong>, each with unique abilities, fighting styles, and progression paths. Build your own strategy as you switch between brute strength, magical intellect, or lethal agility.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open World &amp; Challenging Dungeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mysterious and dangerous dungeons packed with challenges, traps, dark creatures, and hidden secrets. Face <strong>powerful demons</strong> that lurk in the depths and grow stronger as you advance. Every battle rewards you with resources, experience, and opportunities to enhance your hero.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engaging Character Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, distribute attribute points, unlock <strong>devastating spells</strong>, and improve your abilities to shape your character the way you want. The more you evolve, the harder the challenges become — and the more rewarding the victories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to push your limits in an adventure where progression, customization, and strategy go hand in hand. Enter the dungeons… and prove you have what it takes to defeat the darkness consuming this world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Economy &amp; Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins by exploring dungeons, acquire loyal <strong>pet companions</strong>, and purchase <strong>potions</strong> to maximize your survival. Manage your resources wisely and make the most of everything you earn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Progression RPG</strong> focused on leveling up, evolving attributes, unlocking powerful spells, and exploring challenging dungeons — featuring pets, potions, and plenty of action.</p>",
        "short_description": "In Achilles-Sword-ll, explore the dungeons by choosing one of the characters where you will have to fight to survive in a world full of challenges and fantasy.",
